  [(('Explain in 3 steps how water becomes rain','ውኃ እንዴት ዝናብ እንደሚሆን በ3 ደረጃ አብራሩ'),'First, water evaporates. Then, clouds form. Finally, rain falls.'),(('Make passive: "Leaves absorb sunlight."','ተደራጊ አድርጉ፦ "Leaves absorb sunlight."'),'Sunlight is absorbed by leaves.')],
